        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the free demo and try Coreless for yourself before you buy! All your progress carries over to the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/4541873f2267460827ca13f6b76db785.avif?t=1785828810\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras_big/4541873f2267460827ca13f6b76db785.avif?t=1785828810 width=1560 height=624 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coreless is a single-player action roguelite where you fight through enemy swarms, aim explosive abilities, and build around the loot you find. Each run asks how much danger you are willing to take on for stronger rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/da993945a1b9eb8859d745839fa1e080.poster.avif?t=1785828810\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/da993945a1b9eb8859d745839fa1e080.webm?t=1785828810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/da993945a1b9eb8859d745839fa1e080.mp4?t=1785828810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each run, your build takes shape through Powers, Boosters, Chest Items, Challenge Rewards, Special Missions, and Equipment. These choices affect how you move, when you engage, how you handle pressure, and which rewards are worth pursuing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/e0e74f775793113508d382ddf5d9e3ee.poster.avif?t=1785828810\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/e0e74f775793113508d382ddf5d9e3ee.webm?t=1785828810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/e0e74f775793113508d382ddf5d9e3ee.mp4?t=1785828810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk and Treasure Find sit at the center of every run. Raising Treasure Find improves your chances of finding stronger drops and better equipment, while higher Risk makes combat more demanding. As your build comes together, you decide how much pressure is worth taking on for a better payoff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/051bd1739317b07d90c8aee5d29b339e.poster.avif?t=1785828810\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/051bd1739317b07d90c8aee5d29b339e.webm?t=1785828810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/051bd1739317b07d90c8aee5d29b339e.mp4?t=1785828810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat momentum comes from assembling a build while staying in motion. Surge creates burst windows that help you break through crowded fights, clear space, and turn dangerous moments back in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/f68832b675abf66e2b666ca4ab60f41c.poster.avif?t=1785828810\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/f68832b675abf66e2b666ca4ab60f41c.webm?t=1785828810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/f68832b675abf66e2b666ca4ab60f41c.mp4?t=1785828810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, Talents, Research, and Equipment give future builds more direction. Equipment drops with randomized affixes and build-defining modifiers that can push a character toward specific elements, resource loops, defensive setups, or trigger-based playstyles. Talents strengthen your long-term profile and reward flow. Research unlocks new mechanics, event paths, shop options, reward routes, and ways to open future builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/65bedbf595aee86264b05334bf09aa6c.poster.avif?t=1785828810\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/65bedbf595aee86264b05334bf09aa6c.webm?t=1785828810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/65bedbf595aee86264b05334bf09aa6c.mp4?t=1785828810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time action combat built around movement, skills, resources, Powers, and Surge windows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk and Treasure Find decisions that connect combat pressure with reward quality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layered build-making through Powers, Boosters, Chest Items, Challenge Rewards, Special Missions, and Equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized equipment affixes and build-defining modifiers that support distinct playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talents and Research that expand future run options, unlock new mechanics, and shape long-term progression.  </p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the free demo and try Coreless for yourself before you buy! All your progress carries over to the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/4541873f2267460827ca13f6b76db785.avif?t=1785828810\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras_big/4541873f2267460827ca13f6b76db785.avif?t=1785828810 width=1560 height=624 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coreless is a single-player action roguelite where you fight through enemy swarms, aim explosive abilities, and build around the loot you find. Each run asks how much danger you are willing to take on for stronger rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/da993945a1b9eb8859d745839fa1e080.poster.avif?t=1785828810\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/da993945a1b9eb8859d745839fa1e080.webm?t=1785828810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/da993945a1b9eb8859d745839fa1e080.mp4?t=1785828810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each run, your build takes shape through Powers, Boosters, Chest Items, Challenge Rewards, Special Missions, and Equipment. These choices affect how you move, when you engage, how you handle pressure, and which rewards are worth pursuing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/e0e74f775793113508d382ddf5d9e3ee.poster.avif?t=